# Density on the tree, through the docked Graph tools panel: Gastner–Newman's
# evolving field, room following mass. Its signature is the rank of mass
# against area share and an even density, not energy (the flow writes
# positions). Springs from the same arrangement is the negative control, and
# picking Density greys the overlays with the law's reason.
assert snap ready == true
# The boot arrangement pauses the canvas; the receipt wants the law running.
click role:button Play physics
settle 1
assert snap physics-paused == false
# No arrangement: the boot Spiral's anchor springs would pull under every law.
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
# The control: Springs does not give room by mass.
click role:combobox Physics law
settle 1
click role:option Springs
settle 1
click role:button Apply physics
settle 300
assert snap physics-law == spring.rapier
assert snap layout-mass-area-rank <= 0.79
capture physics_density_springs_control
settle 2
# An overlay ticked under Springs is refused once Density is picked.
click role:checkbox Tide
settle 1
assert snap panel-overlays == tide
assert snap disabled-overlays == 0
click role:combobox Physics law
settle 1
click role:option Density
settle 1
assert snap disabled-overlays == 8
assert text Density takes no overlays
capture physics_density_refused
settle 2
click role:button Apply physics
settle 1
assert snap physics-law == density.gastner-newman
assert snap physics-profile == law.density
assert snap panel-profile == law.density
assert text Physics set to Density
capture physics_density_start
settle 2
# Past the pass cap (120 one-second passes; up to three ticks a frame here).
# Play runs the canvas until paused, so `wait` cannot see the law stop: the
# law's own demand for ticks can, and drops once its passes are done.
settle 5000
assert snap physics-continuous == false
capture physics_density_settled
settle 2
assert snap layout-mass-area-rank >= 0.8
assert snap layout-density-cv <= 0.35
assert snap layout-overlaps == 0
log physics density receipt complete
